--- !u!114 &8807465531377669270
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4680934963597762750}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d32f5a5fd94ac34d9aa80615b221c7f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: Oh, Daniel. Hey there.
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: Hey, Lester.
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: Sorry for bothering you this early.
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "I would\u2026 but I don\u2019t have a gramophone anymore."
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "Sounds like the orchestra\u2019s already wide awake."
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: Oh, that it is.
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: 'You know, nothing sets the mood for a good day like some good

      music
      in the morning. You should try it sometime.'
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "I would\u2026 but I don\u2019t have a gramophone anymore."
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: "That\u2019s a shame to hear."
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: "Sorry\u2026 Did the music wake you?"
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "No, that\u2019s not why I came. I wanted to ask you something."
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: Do you know a man with an umbrella?
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: "A man with\u2026 what?"
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: An umbrella.
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: Black one. I saw him here in the building yesterday.
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: "No\u2026 I don\u2019t think so. I usually don\u2019t pay much attention
      to\r\nthe other tenants."
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: Do you think he lives here?
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: "Well, how else would he get inside? Someone must\u2019ve let him\r\nin."
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: "I don\u2019t know many people here myself."
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: "You should ask the old-timers in the building. They\u2019ve been here
      for years \u2014 they probably know everyone. Maybe they know your umbrella
      man too."
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "Alright. I\u2019ll ask around."
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: "So\u2026 what\u2019s this about, anyway?"
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "Yesterday, when I was taking out the trash\u2026 something strange
      happened."
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "I was this close\u2026 at least it felt that way."
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: Someone had been inside my apartment. Then some lunatic attacked me.
      I managed to get away, though.
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: And then, out of nowhere, he appeared. The man with the umbrella.
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "He just stood there\u2026 watching me."
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "I don\u2019t know. Maybe it has nothing to do with him. But something
      about it felt\u2026 wrong."
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: Wow, Daniel.
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: Maybe I should get out of the apartment more often.
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: "Are you sure you\u2019re alright?"
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "I think so\u2026"
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "It\u2019s just\u2026 I\u2019m scared."
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: "I could\u2019ve been lying somewhere out there today instead of\r\ntalking
      to you."
  - speakerName: Lester
    sentence: There are plenty of crazies out there.
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: Be careful.
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: I will.
  - speakerName: Daniel
    sentence: Thanks, Lester.
  interactionPrompt: {fileID: 0}
